{"unit_id":"juliankang4__dsh-locale-ko#card-zh","repo":"juliankang4/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"bdad6973147b17ecd8283ffbf73fbf931cf0c32f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 是为 DSH 网页客户端提供韩语界面的语言包插件。它通过注入 locale 客户端模块，将韩语语言选项加入 DSH，并按命名空间注册翻译词典。主要功能包括翻译 DSH 核心界面的菜单、按钮、提示和错误信息；为已收录的第三方插件界面提供韩语词条；根据英文原文匹配不同版本的界面文案。适合希望用韩语操作 DSH 网页界面，或同时本地化受支持插件界面的用户。安装需要使用 DSH 插件管理命令，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:27-36","client.js:10077-10149"]}
{"unit_id":"juliankang4__dsh-locale-ko#card-en","repo":"juliankang4/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"bdad6973147b17ecd8283ffbf73fbf931cf0c32f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-locale-ko adds Korean to the DSH web client's locale options. It registers translations for core interface and included plugin namespaces, and matches known English wording variants to Korean text. Users can use supported DSH screens in Korean without an API key or external account.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:27-36","client.js:10077-10149"]}
