{"unit_id":"juliankang4__dsh-locale-ko#feature-1","repo":"juliankang4/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"bdad6973147b17ecd8283ffbf73fbf931cf0c32f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 的功能「核心界面韩语化」：为 DSH 核心界面注册韩语词条。安装并启用插件后，locale 服务提供韩语选项和对应的命名空间翻译。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:10082-10120"]}
{"unit_id":"juliankang4__dsh-locale-ko#feature-2","repo":"juliankang4/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"bdad6973147b17ecd8283ffbf73fbf931cf0c32f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 的功能「插件界面翻译」：为内置词典中包含的第三方插件命名空间提供韩语翻译。插件注册界面后，扩展尝试挂载对应词典，并在同一语言已由插件注册时保留已有翻译。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:10122-10149"]}
{"unit_id":"juliankang4__dsh-locale-ko#feature-3","repo":"juliankang4/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"bdad6973147b17ecd8283ffbf73fbf931cf0c32f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 的功能「版本文案匹配」：当 DSH 使用的英文文案存在已知变体时，按当前英文内容选择对应的韩语译文。locale 变化时会重新同步匹配结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:10087-10120"]}
